/* GENERATED by gen_hcon4_stitched.py -- models are generated, never hand-edited.
   CENTRAL VIEW 42 -- the layer the governing rule is about.
   spine hub    : HUB_POLICY   (9 of 10 table(s) join on it unambiguously)
   tables joined: 10 of 10 in the group; 0 refused from the join
   rule 1/3     : within the limit of 10
   rule 2       : feeds 4 satellite(s) WHOLE. No satellite in this build is split
                  across views; the plan asserts that by re-counting homes.
   rules 5/6    : 13 hub key(s) resolve on this view, so its hubs and its 0 link(s)
                  are derived FROM here and not from anywhere else.
   satellites   : SAT_FIN_CHARGE_RATE, SAT_POLICY_GROUP, SAT_POLICY_INTERMEDIARY_SPLIT, SAT_POLICY_LIFECYCLE
