   merge order  : R8 source precedence, carried from v3 (BD6 as corrected): v2 is the closed, settled half, so v2 > legacy > delta3. Under the central-view rule this precedence lives in the stitched views COALESCE order, which is where a sideways merge belongs, instead of in the satellite loader.
   grain        : one row per join key plus the resolved child-key legs of 2 multi-active satellite(s)
   NOT hashed   : this view computes no hash. Hashing happens exactly once, downstream,
                  in stage_42_policy.
*/
{{ config(materialized='view') }}

with t0 as (
    select
        partner_id as HUB_DISTRIBUTION_CHANNEL_BK__PARTNER_ID,
        card_no as HUB_DOCUMENT_BK__CARD_NO,
